# OpenTofu / Terraform working files
**/.terraform/*
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Lock files are not committed in this repo: the projects are run with both
# terraform (registry.terraform.io) and tofu (registry.opentofu.org), and a lock
# file only matches the CLI/registry that created it. Pin versions in
# required_providers instead. See README.md -> "Lock files".
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Variable files can hold secrets. Commit *.tfvars.example instead.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
# project1 values are plain names (no secrets) and are kept on purpose
!project1/terraform.tfvars

# Local env / tools
.env
*.env
!.env.example
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
